ng  unemployment it's just the above and  beyond unemployment  a lot of our employers in the district  have been very upset  with the enhanced unemployment they feel  like that's led to a higher unemployment  rate because  a lot of people unfortunately  have made as much or in some cases more  money drawing extended unemployment so  we've got to get unemployment under  control in kentucky  we have an unemployment bureaucracy  that's helped  that's prevented people that deserve to  be unemployed and drawing unemployment  insurance from getting unemployment and  some that have just  abused their unemployment because there  are a lot of problems with unemployment  but the reason that we have a high  unemployment rate is because our  governor shuts our state down  you know i wish kentucky was operated  more like south dakota with governor  noam or florida with governor desantis  well coach  yes but there's also a pandemic going on  i mean states across the country are  dealing with these  uh unemployment numbers congressman  thank you so much and best of luck  getting this pandemic under control  in your state thank you for having me  you bet
 

